        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.hallmarkchannel.com/a-suite-holiday-romance",
          "overview": "During Christmas week, Sabrina jumps at the opportunity to ghostwrite a memoir for a famous art dealer at the iconic Grand Fairbanks Hotel in New York City. The week gets complicated when she meets a handsome British visitor at the hotel bar; she thinks he’s a member of the British aristocracy, and he thinks she’s a wealthy hotel guest.",
          "runtime": 84,
